<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zilog rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zilog rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co said its analyst Dan Niles cut his rating on Zilog Inc to market performer from buy after the company late Wednesday said it expects third quarter earnings to fall &quot;substantially below&quot; the second quarter's $0.60 a share.</p>
<p>-- Niles also cut his earnings estimate for 1996 to $1.43 a share from $2.13 and for 1997 to $1.15 from $2.45.</p>
</text>
